  "description": "Azzure Aoud is a refined woody oud fragrance that blends smoky woods, warm spices, and smooth amber into a luxurious unisex scent. The fragrance feels bold, elegant, and modern while maintaining a rich Middle Eastern character with a clean sophisticated finish. The opening introduces spicy accords and fresh aromatic nuances, creating a vibrant and slightly smoky first impression with warm depth. The heart develops into oud, woods, and soft florals, adding richness and smooth complexity balanced by elegant warmth. The base settles into amber, musk, patchouli, and creamy woods, leaving a warm, woody, and long-lasting trail that feels luxurious, smooth, and captivating. Azzure Aoud is perfect for those who enjoy modern oud fragrances with woody warmth and refined amber depth.",
